1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,586
Since August 2026 the law wants generated content marked.

2
00:00:03,586 --> 00:00:07,833
Studios ship dozens of generated assets a week; the reviewer
checks by hand,

3
00:00:07,833 --> 00:00:12,360
and nobody can prove which one was checked, or that the
check itself was working.

4
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:16,953
Airlock: four gates, then a verdict that asks Grafana before
it rules.

5
00:00:16,953 --> 00:00:20,510
Every line under a gate is Grafana's word, not the gate's.

6
00:00:21,083 --> 00:00:23,760
A real commercial with a real trademark on screen.

7
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:27,936
The four gates run in parallel on Vertex AI Agent Engine
while the clip plays.

8
00:00:28,236 --> 00:00:34,201
Provenance is a cryptographic check, not an opinion: this
film was shot decades before C2PA existed.

9
00:00:34,701 --> 00:00:40,499
Brand: the charter forbids health claims, comparisons and
children, and the house wordmark is not even there.

10
00:00:40,999 --> 00:00:43,110
Click the time and the clip goes there.

11
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:45,492
Every claim with its timestamp and its rule:

12
00:00:45,492 --> 00:00:51,555
a consumer testimonial under the Endorsement Guides, an
efficacy claim under section five with no study on file.

13
00:00:52,055 --> 00:00:52,450
Rights:

14
00:00:52,450 --> 00:00:58,821
Video Intelligence found the logo, the dental association's
seal and the faces; the registry clears none of them.

15
00:01:00,963 --> 00:01:04,479
Before it rules, the verdict asks Grafana five things about
each

16
00:01:04,479 --> 00:01:08,214
gate, starting with: did Loki see this gate report on this
very run.

17
00:01:08,214 --> 00:01:14,367
Then it writes the verdict back as an annotation, and the
escalation opens the incident for the clearance owner.

18
00:01:14,367 --> 00:01:16,784
Half a dollar at list price, and it says so.

19
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:21,675
A clean generated asset, signed.

20
00:01:21,675 --> 00:01:26,769
Now we break the instrument on purpose: the rights gate will
time out before it reads anything.

21
00:01:27,069 --> 00:01:29,405
The gate fails in a millisecond and says so.

22
00:01:29,405 --> 00:01:30,998
The other three read the clip.

23
00:01:31,998 --> 00:01:33,016
Three gates pass.

24
00:01:33,016 --> 00:01:34,812
And the verdict still refuses.

25
00:01:35,312 --> 00:01:37,552
A control that failed is not a control.

26
00:01:37,552 --> 00:01:41,457
Then the investigator, the one language model agent in the
pipeline,

27
00:01:41,457 --> 00:01:47,774
reads Loki through the same Grafana MCP server: this run's
line, the previous runs, the alert that just fired.

28
00:01:48,290 --> 00:01:52,455
It names the cause and the second it happened, and writes it
into the incident.

29
00:01:52,455 --> 00:01:54,459
Grafana's alert rule fires on its own.

30
00:01:55,418 --> 00:01:58,678
A human closes the loop from the console: the incident
resolves,

31
00:01:58,678 --> 00:02:02,854
and the decision lands on the dashboard as an annotation
with the reviewer's role.

32
00:02:03,424 --> 00:02:09,048
The Nimbus test clip blocks on one claim, nine out of ten
sommeliers, with nothing behind it.

33
00:02:09,048 --> 00:02:12,132
The studio puts the study on file beside the asset.

34
00:02:12,132 --> 00:02:13,462
Same clip, same gates.

35
00:02:13,762 --> 00:02:19,303
Provenance: signed, and marked as generated, the
machine-readable marking Article 50 asks for.

36
00:02:19,603 --> 00:02:22,113
Claim passes and names the study it rests on.

37
00:02:22,613 --> 00:02:27,494
Every gate seen by Grafana on this run, healthy, and
calibrated by this morning's proof:

38
00:02:27,494 --> 00:02:33,762
a scheduled job injects a real defect into every gate twice
a day and a gate that misses loses its right to pass.

39
00:02:33,762 --> 00:02:36,757
This is the PASS the reviewer no longer signs by hand.

40
00:02:37,758 --> 00:02:40,356
Every verdict is an annotation on this dashboard.

41
00:02:40,356 --> 00:02:43,855
Every block that needs a human is an incident that a human
closes.

42
00:02:43,855 --> 00:02:48,521
Every gate proves itself twice a day, and the cost of every
check is on the same screen.

43
00:02:50,272 --> 00:02:54,917
Nothing ships without a gate that has already caught a real
defect, seen by Grafana.

44
00:02:54,917 --> 00:02:55,802
That is Airlock.
